WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:45.900
Yuji!

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:50.980
It's not over!

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:54.650
You aren't going to recognize us!?

00:01:54.650 --> 00:02:00.320
Are we...

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.050
Are we that much of an inconvenience to you!?

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:05.520
Yuji!

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:52.970
Yuji!!

00:02:52.970 --> 00:02:54.310
I'm all right...

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.980
All units, deploy! Give Yuji support!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.000
Roger!

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:08.480
Why, you...!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.330
Dammit! It's too fast!

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:24.670
All units be careful! It's strong! Ted, stick with me!

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.340
R- right!

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:30.180
The two of us will draw it out. Everyone else, back us up!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.610
Marlene, you analyze where this thing's core is!

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.280
R- roger!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:39.340
<i>I've come this far...</i> <i>I am not about to end it here!</i>

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.290
Let's go!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.150
Ted!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.870
- Ted!
- Dammit!

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:39.280
Yuji!?

00:04:39.280 --> 00:04:41.280
What is it? Where's the core!?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.280
- There is none!
- Wha...?

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:46.290
That can't be! That can't be right!

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.290
Still, there's no reading like it showing up on the sensors!

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.630
I can't locate anywhere equivalent to a core on these Blue!

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:56.220
What do we do, Yuji?

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.660
It can only be in there!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.130
Aim for the openings between its muscle fibers!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.460
If it doesn't have a core,

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:31.600
we'll just attack its insides directly and blow it apart!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.600
In that case...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.940
...Ted!?

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:39.270
Draw its eyes away from me!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.330
Here goes!

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.260
Ted!

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:10.690
Ted!!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:35.900
Yuji!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:06.820
Yuji...

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:24.600
Ultimately, it's my fault... again...

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:30.310
I'm the one who brought everyone into this place.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:33.640
Yuji, that's not true...

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:54.690
Let's go, together.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:21.590
This is where we part, Marlene.

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:23.960
Yuji...?

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:27.300
From here on, I am going alone.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:53.250
Yuji?

00:09:57.930 --> 00:10:01.940
Yuji, what did you just say?

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:05.270
From here on, I'm going alone.

00:10:05.270 --> 00:10:08.610
Marlene, would you join up with the platoon up on the surface...

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:13.610
...before the batteries in the Armor Shrike cut out, and wait for me at that village?

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:15.450
How come?

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.280
Why would you say something like that after we've come this far?

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.290
I don't know what lies ahead.

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:26.960
I don't want to expose you to any further danger, Marlene.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:29.960
Danger, you say?

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.100
I'm expecting as much!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.770
If you're going, Yuji, then I'm going too.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:37.570
Isn't that how it is, Yuji?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.910
Listen to me, Marlene.

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.780
No matter what happens...

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:46.180
If it was the Earth that gave birth to the B cells,

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.750
and since I have those same B cells,

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:52.590
if I was awakened by its will, I might be spared.

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:55.490
But what would happen to you, Marlene?

00:10:55.490 --> 00:11:00.430
When it comes to normal humans with no B cells...

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:05.270
If by any chance something were to happen to you, Marlene, I...

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:07.600
I don't...

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.270
...want to let anyone else die.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.710
Either you, Marlene, or the people of Earth...

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:18.280
Indeed, everyone, including the children who will be born from now on.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:22.320
Besides, Marlene...

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.290
Marlene, I absolutely want you at least to stay alive.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:26.720
Yuji...

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.590
For me?

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:41.790
For the children who will be born from now on?

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.640
In that case...!

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:47.270
In that case, more than ever, I want us to be together!

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:53.340
If you tell me to go back, then Yuji, you're staying together with me!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.820
That's right, let's go back to the village together.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:01.350
If people discard civilization, and live like those...

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.320
villagers' children do,

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:08.060
then maybe people can coexist with the Earth.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:12.020
If it's just us, then maybe we can go on living, can't we?

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:19.010
Marlene...

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:22.740
Please, don't leave me alone!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.350
No matter what happens, I will be together with you, Yuji!

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:27.840
We must be together!

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:38.190
For our child, who is yet to be born.

00:12:53.640 --> 00:13:00.650
Child...? Ours...? Marlene...

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:04.320
I don't know what I should do alone.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:08.490
For the first time... I'm afraid.

00:13:08.490 --> 00:13:14.890
lf... if I were to lose you, Yuji, I'd...

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.160
Yuji...?

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:29.910
You can't, Marlene. As long as there are people on the surface,

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:32.350
and as long as they keep on multiplying,

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:36.620
the B cells are certain to act to fulfill their role.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:39.450
That's why I need to confirm this!

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:40.590
Whether or not the B cells...

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:45.960
the Earth, is really an enemy toward humans. Otherwise...

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:49.960
if left alone, at some time, the same thing is sure to happen again.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.690
And this time to our child...

00:13:54.300 --> 00:14:00.840
So that it doesn't happen- no, to keep it from happening, I am going.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:03.310
To learn what it is that the Earth wants...

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:06.980
To learn what the existence of the B cells means to the Earth...

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:09.280
To know the real reason why Marlene,

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:13.320
you and I met, and are living in this era...

00:14:13.320 --> 00:14:16.760
For our child...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.090
Yuji...

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:34.270
So that I can keep on living with you, Marlene, I am going.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:37.610
But I will surely come back!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.800
Yuji...

00:16:56.950 --> 00:16:59.140
<i>What is this light?</i>

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:53.630
<i>So that's it. That's why I'm here...</i>

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.160
<i>I see...</i>

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:33.000
<i>And so, that's why you are now reborn...</i>

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.880
<i>For new life...</i>

00:19:59.390 --> 00:20:00.680
<i>Marlene...</i>

00:20:16.320 --> 00:20:21.080
From deep within your breast,
mune no oku sakende mite mo

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:28.140
you try to call out, but the cry reaches no one.
dare ni mo todokanai sou kotoba ni

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:30.820
You have to keep on putting it into words!
shite ikanakya

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:38.680
These chains that we call fate bind us hand and foot
unmei to iu na no kusari teashi wo tsunagarete

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:42.880
while you
ima anata wa

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:51.460
Vaguely lament over the weaknesses you have now.
jibun no yowasa aimai ni nageku kedo

00:20:51.500 --> 00:21:00.900
But unless you try to become strong, you'll never change!
tsuyoku narou to shinakereba kawaranai yo

00:21:00.990 --> 00:21:03.190
Set you free now!

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:09.510
Come on, let it all go, while your heart beat runs hot,
saa tokihanate atsui kodou no mama ni

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:15.410
From everything that stands in your way!
anata wo jama suru mono wo

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:17.490
For your heartbeat!

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:23.870
Even more than memories, the future brightly shines,
omoide yori mo motto kagayaku asu de

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:34.430
To reunite you with the one you love more than any other.
dare yori ai suru hito ni meguriau tame ni

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:45.640
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

