00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:47.770
Marlene...

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.440
Yuji...

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:52.770
Let us live, here on this Earth,

00:22:52.770 --> 00:22:55.670
together with everyone.

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:39.800
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:45.930
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:23:48.140 --> 00:23:55.080
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:23:55.200 --> 00:24:01.250
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:07.670
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:14.860
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:24:15.050 --> 00:24:20.020
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:26.080
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:24:26.380 --> 00:24:32.360
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:24:32.970 --> 00:24:39.840
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:24:40.020 --> 00:24:46.700
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi
